      "description": "<p>The dreshkan braces itself on all four limbs and sprays needles at as many creatures as it would like in a 30ft Cone, dealing 2d4 Piercing Damage|options:area-damage]{2d4 piercing damage plus 2d8 electricity damage}. Each targeted creature in the area must attempt a Basic DC 21 Reflex Saving Throw.</p>",
